      "id": "claim_b0686290ff824f8e99d571b970a6d0ad",
      "statement": "Tool access policies use the @access decorator with a Policy object specifying where a tool may run (anywhere, private thread, admin_thread, or admin_surface), who can use it (anyone, owner, or admin), and optional result projection for sole writers; the access decorator rechecks at runtime, applies sole-writer projection when appropriate, and returns a refused error if the current run's Access mode does not permit the tool.",
